          "distinct": false,
          "id": "ba929c74577df51bfbc6653f6f6b0c092d37750a",
          "message": "feat(zk/xpath): DayTimeDuration overloads for years/months-from-duration (duration.nr) (sq-u91ki) [SONNET-4.6] (#1547)\n\n* (sq-u91ki) feat(zk/xpath): DayTimeDuration overloads for years/months-from-duration [SONNET-4.6]\n\nF&O sec. 8.4.3 / 8.4.4: fn:years-from-duration and fn:months-from-duration\napplied to xs:dayTimeDuration always return 0 (a dayTimeDuration carries no\nyears or months component).\n\nAdds years_from_duration_dt / months_from_duration_dt to duration.nr, exported\nfrom lib.nr and xpath_fn.nr. Five new in-file tests:\n  - positive dayTimeDuration -> 0 (F&O sec. 8.4.3, 8.4.4)\n  - negative dayTimeDuration -> 0\n  - zero dayTimeDuration -> 0 (degenerate)\nMutation spot-check: flipping expected 0 -> 1 causes the test to fail (PASS).\n\nThe _dt suffix distinguishes these from the yearMonthDuration variants\n(years_from_duration / months_from_duration) which remain exported unchanged\nas regression guards (test_ym_duration_components still passes).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (sq-u91ki) refactor: same-name generic dispatch for years/months-from-duration; de-list qt3tests packages from KNOWN_FAILING [SONNET-4.6]\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-05T06:57:41Z",
          "tree_id": "1f8839a744da4f160f1dc349db866cfc6bbfc3ee",
